.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/3c956c78ef7821f545a9e673b3f5f7c6?_a=AQAEuj9","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2025-01-20T17:37:12.248Z"},{"id":"L5Ye8eCMP","title":"The Psychology Behind McDonald\u2019s $2 Billion Self-Serve Kiosks","url":"https://growth.design/case-studies/mcdonalds-self-serve-ux","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/the-psychology-behind-mcdonald-s-2-billion-self-serve-kiosks-l5ye8ecmp","summary":"McDonald's has invested $2 billion in self-serve kiosks, which are designed to enhance customer experience and streamline operations. This technology leverages psychological principles to influence purchasing behavior, potentially increasing sales for the fast food giant.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/84bc748d39fd643a659da7faa905d5bf?_a=AQAEuiZ","num_upvotes":16,"num_comments":2,"created_at":"2024-09-18T04:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"jjXyktbhV","title":"Scarcity: 3 pillars to using it ethically","url":"https://growth.design/case-studies/scarcity","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/scarcity-3-pillars-to-using-it-ethically-jjxyktbhv","summary":"Scarcity can be a powerful tool in marketing, but it must be used ethically. The post outlines three key pillars to ensure that scarcity tactics do not mislead or exploit consumers. Understanding these principles can help businesses build trust and drive demand responsibly.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/22aec2691add6289404b2d58a10a9adf?_a=AQAEuiZ","num_upvotes":2,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-09-11T04:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"n0HWMyrbM","title":"How to Craft Onboarding Surveys Users Love: 5 Do\u2019s and Don\u2019ts","url":"https://growth.design/case-studies/grammarly-onboarding-survey","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/how-to-craft-onboarding-surveys-users-love-5-do-s-and-don-ts-n0hwmyrbm","summary":"Tips for creating effective onboarding surveys include understanding user needs